{
  "description": "Round trip of a take that sets every new value, per case. form: the fields the Audio tab posts, none for a control the model hides such as Stable Audio's Lyrics under Music (also the job's recorded settings, which Retry and Load settings read). reuse_form: the fields after a Reuse, when they differ (a recording has no delivery; a length left on Auto stays Auto, because the take records the length asked for apart from the one it was made at). request: the request the form makes (seed aside). payload: the settings the FLAC records. reuse: the Gallery Reuse params (an enhanced take adds its record as sorted JSON under enhance, as the FLAC stores it). retry: what jobSettingsPrefill makes of form. A voice path under /voices/ is moved into a scratch folder by the tests.",
